#: ../../tools/modeldb_tools.rst:36 2ce848a517984822a40c616ee75032f4
msgid ""
"``celltype_id`` (string) (required) Cell type ID from ModelDB. Examples: "
"'259' (Hippocampus CA3 pyramidal GLU cell), '258' (Hippocampus CA1 "
"pyramidal GLU cell), '263' (Cerebellum Purkinje GABA cell). Find IDs "
"using ModelDB\\_list\\_celltypes."
msgstr ""

